itle>患者体内短暂和慢性感染细菌之间的基因转移在肺部感染期间导致极端的抗生素耐药性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/withinpatient-gene-transfer-between-transiently-and-chronically-infecting-bacteria-causes-extreme-antibiotic-resistance-during-lung-infections-microbiology</link><description>抗生素抗性基因的获得&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/withinpatient-gene-transfer-between-transiently-and-chronically-infecting-bacteria-causes-extreme-antibiotic-resistance-during-lung-infections-microbiology.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:44:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/withinpatient-gene-transfer-between-transiently-and-chronically-infecting-bacteria-causes-extreme-antibiotic-resistance-during-lung-infections-microbiology</guid></item><item><title>强大的线粒体：科学家发现了对抗细菌感染（包括耐药超级细菌）的新作用</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mighty-mitochondria-scientists-uncover-new-role-for-fighting-bacterial-infections-including-drug-resistant-superbugs</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mighty-mitochondria-scientists-uncover-new-role-for-fighting-bacterial-infections-including-drug-resistant-superbugs.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:29:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mighty-mitochondria-scientists-uncover-new-role-for-fighting-bacterial-infections-including-drug-resistant-superbugs</guid></item><item><title>受欢迎的来源与可靠的来源——法学硕士评估信息的盲点</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/popular-vs-reliable-sources-a-blind-spot-in-how-llms-assess-information</link><description>大型语言模型 (LLM) 是支撑 ChatGPT 和类似对话平台的人工智能 (AI) 系统，现在被世界各地的许多人用来查找和总结信息并生成不同类型的文本。尽管它们被广泛使用，但这些模型仍然具有明显的局限性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/popular-vs-reliable-sources-a-blind-spot-in-how-llms-assess-information.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:14:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/popular-vs-reliable-sources-a-blind-spot-in-how-llms-assess-information</guid></item><item><title>机械血栓切除术治疗伴有中度或远端动脉闭塞的缺血性中风</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mechanical-thrombectomy-in-ischemic-stroke-with-medium-or-distal-arterial-occlusion</link><description>这项随机临床试验评估了与单纯药物治疗相比，机械血栓切除术联合药物治疗对于患有原发性和孤立性中段和远端血管闭塞的急性缺血性卒中成年患者的益处。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mechanical-thrombectomy-in-ischemic-stroke-with-medium-or-distal-arterial-occlusion.png" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 23:59:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mechanical-thrombectomy-in-ischemic-stroke-with-medium-or-distal-arterial-occlusion</guid></item><item><title>“前面有危险的水域！”超级智能机器人会终结人类吗？ + 科学与上帝之争</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/treacherous-waters-ahead-will-super-intelligent-robots-end-humanity-science-vs-god-debate</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 23:44:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/treacherous-waters-ahead-will-super-intelligent-robots-end-humanity-science-vs-god-debate</guid></item><item><title>数学和理论计算机科学的十大进展</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ten-advances-in-mathematics-and-theoretical-computer-science</link><description>OpenAI 分享了数学和理论计算机科学中长期存在的开放问题的新成果，包括几何、密码学和复杂性方面的进展。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ten-advances-in-mathematics-and-theoretical-computer-science.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 23:29:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ten-advances-in-mathematics-and-theoretical-computer-science</guid></item><item><title>正常的氧气水平可能会忽略二氧化碳引起的严重呼吸困难</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/normal-oxygen-levels-can-miss-severe-breathlessness-driven-by-carbon-dioxide</link><description>加州大学河滨分校生物医学科学家埃里卡·海因里希 (Erica Heinri